<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-HOOKER CANCELS WEDDING.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-HOOKER CANCELS WEDDING.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Lions reserve hooker Barry Williams has been forced to postpone his wedding following his surprise call-up to the 35-man squad to tour South Africa.</p>
<p>The 23-year-old Welshman had expected to marry fiancee Diane on May 24, the date of the Lions' opening tour fixture in Port Elizabeth.</p>
<p>&quot;Diane has been worrying about it all,&quot; admitted Williams. &quot;We probably won't be able to get married on a Saturday now because it will be booked up by the time I get back. We might have to settle for a Friday.&quot;</p>
</text>
